flowchart TD
    Req[Requete client] --> Auth[Authorization: Bearer API key]
    Auth --> KeyHash[hash SHA-256 de la cle]
    KeyHash --> Tenant[tenant_id interne depuis api_keys]
    Tenant --> RejectBody{tenantId/customerId dans body ?}
    RejectBody -- Oui --> Deny1[400 VALIDATION_ERROR]
    RejectBody -- Non --> Target{Type de cible}
    Target -- Web --> WebCheck[HTTPS + host public + tenant_web_targets]
    Target -- Azure tenant --> TenantScope[tenant_azure_scopes tenant-level CONSENTED/VERIFIED]
    Target -- Azure subscription --> SubScope[tenant_azure_scopes subscription VERIFIED]
    WebCheck --> Allow{autorise ?}
    TenantScope --> Allow
    SubScope --> Allow
    Allow -- Non --> Deny2[403 FORBIDDEN]
    Allow -- Oui --> Quota[quota mensuel + resource_limit]
    Quota --> Queue[Service Bus scan-jobs]
